                items: [
                  {
                    text: 'LA Seotda: Modern variant using a standard 52-card poker deck; adds Ttaeng Value (bonus winnings for strong hands like GwangTtaeng or Ttaeng) and poker-style hand rankings (e.g. Four of a Kind, Straight Flush).',
                  },
                ],
              },
